menu "Console"

config CONSOLE
    bool "Enable buffered system console"
    depends on ARTOS
    default y
    help
      Build the system console on the UART selected by DTS artos,console.
      Requires ARTOS blocking waits and deferred RX processing.
      The receive buffer has one ISR producer and one thread consumer.

config CONSOLE_RX_BUFFER_SIZE
    int "Console receive buffer bytes"
    depends on CONSOLE
    range 2 65536
    default 256
    help
      Size of the static receive ring buffer. One slot is reserved, so
      usable capacity is one byte smaller. The linker checks RAM usage.

endmenu
